...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
model_chain: ModelChain { class: ours }
agent: agno Agent { class: ours }
claude_api: Claude API { class: ext }

ui -> model_chain: get_claude_response(prompt, deepseek_output) 호출
model_chain -> agent: agent.run(message=질문+DeepSeek reasoning·분석) 호출
agent -> claude_api: 시스템 프롬프트 + message
claude_api -> agent: Messages 응답(content 블록)
agent -> model_chain: RunOutput(.content) 반환
model_chain -> ui: response 문자열 반환
